    "introduction": "Reckitt develops and markets branded health, hygiene and nutrition products used by consumers around the world. Its portfolio includes names such as Dettol, Durex, Gaviscon, Nurofen, Finish and Lysol, alongside infant-nutrition products. Goods reach customers through pharmacies, supermarkets and online retailers. Revenue comes from repeat purchases, supported by brand familiarity, product performance and retail availability. The business combines formulation, marketing and manufacturing across categories with different seasonal and consumer-demand patterns. Product safety and quality are particularly important in health and nutrition. Pricing, competition and ingredient or packaging costs influence margins, while changes to the portfolio affect the mix of businesses represented by the group.",
